2
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.000
At the beginning of the 21st century.
the Umbrella Corporation...

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
had become the largest commercial
entity in the United States.

4
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.600
Nine out of every ten homes
contain its products.

5
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.600
Its political and financial
influence is felt everywhere.

6
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.600
In public. it is the world's
leading supplier...

7
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.600
of computer technology.
medical products and health care.

8
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.800
Unknown even to its own employees...

9
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.400
its massive profits are generated
by military technology...

10
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.600
genetic experimentation
and viral weaponry.

11
00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:40.300
All Umbrella staff must wear
their identity tags at all times.

12
00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:46.300
All radiation badges will be collected
at 5:00 p.m. this afternoon.

13
00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.200
Thank you! God!

14
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.100
Some people.

15
00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.200
Yeah.

16
00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.100
- Don't show this to me.
- Why not?

17
00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.900
Because I'm busy.

18
00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:37.000
It's nothing. Fire drill.

19
00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:50.100
- What is that?
- Fire drill.

20
00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.300
- Shit!
- Hey. what the hell is going on?

21
00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.000
- Get the computers covered! Move it!
- Damn it. I'm trying!

22
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.000
The experiments! Move them!

23
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.700
Shouldn't the doors
open or something?

24
00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.900
It's supposed to take us
to the nearest floor.

25
00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.000
What's happening?

26
00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.100
Line's dead.

27
00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.600
- What's the problem?
- The doors won't open.

28
00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.500
- What about the ones at the back?
- Locked as well.

29
00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.300
There's no fire here!
No fire!

30
00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.800
- The code doesn't work!
- No fire!

31
00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.200
- What's wrong with you?
- The door won't open!

32
00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.700
And this water
isn't going anywhere.

33
00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.200
- What?
- It's a sealed room.

34
00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:56.400
- Help me with the door!
- Oh. fuck the doors!

35
00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:08.900
We have to get out of here.
What's going on?

36
00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:12.400
Has this happened before?
We have to get out of here.

37
00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.200
- We have to get out of here!
- Take it easy.

38
00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.300
- You take it easy!
- Quiet!

39
00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.000
What is that?

40
00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.700
Oh. my God.

41
00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.700
Halon!

42
00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.100
Stop it!

43
00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:20.400
Stop it! Stop!

44
00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:24.900
Help!

45
00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:58.400
Let me see.

46
00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:07.500
We're gonna have to get out of here.
We have to get out of this building!

47
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.900
Here. give me a hand.

48
00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:14.000
That's as far as they'll go.
They're caught on something.

49
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:18.000
That's wide enough.
I can squeeze through. I'll get help.

50
00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:27.600
I'm stuck.
You're gonna have to push.

51
00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:30.200
That's it.

52
00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.500
A bit more.

53
00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:34.800
What was that?

54
00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:40.200
Oh. Christ!
It's the brakes! Get out!

55
00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.600
- I can't move!
- We have to get out of here!

56
00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.700
Push her out of the way!

57
00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.500
Pull me back inside!

58
00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.600
Pull me back inside!

59
00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.500
Hello?

60
00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.100
- Who are you?
- Move!

61
00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.600
Don't touch me! Stop!

62
00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.100
- Get away from me!
- Down!

63
00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.600
What are you doing?
I'm a cop!

64
00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:08.900
I told you. I'm a cop!

65
00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.000
You're breaking my arm!

66
00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:25.500
Report.

67
00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.900
Report now.

68
00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:32.400
What?

69
00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.800
I want your report. soldier.

70
00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.900
I don't know
what you're talking about.

71
00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:41.400
Sir. the house's primary
defenses have been activated.

72
00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.100
She's probably still suffering
the side effects.

73
00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:45.600
What are you doing with us?

74
00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.400
What about the cop?

75
00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:50.900
Matthew Addison.
I'm not getting a match.

76
00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.500
Who are you?

77
00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:55.900
I just transferred. They probably
don't even have me on file yet.

78
00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:58.000
The locals are inefficient.
It's possible.

79
00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.100
Should I secure him here?

80
00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.500
No. We take him with us.

81
00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:10.200
You can't do this!

82
00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.400
Blow me.

83
00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.500
Prep for entry to the Hive.

84
00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:28.000
Power's down.

85
00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:30.500
- So fix it.
- I'm on it.

86
00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:29.300
Are you done yet?

87
00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:30.400
Jumpy.

88
00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.500
Stand clear!

89
00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.900
- You got a problem?
- How's that door?

90
00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.200
- It's sealed shut.
- Let me.

91
00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:35.700
Jumpy?

92
00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:12.100
Lie still. Lie still!

93
00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:16.100
Watch this light.
Follow it.

94
00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.800
- Now. how many fingers am I holding up?
- Three.

95
00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.000
Good.

96
00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.900
Now tell me your name.

97
00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.100
I don't know.

98
00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:35.900
He's fine. Memory loss.
just like the other one.

99
00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:17.900
Let's open that door.

100
00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.100
Listen to me. I want to know
who you people are...

101
00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:44.500
and I want to know
what's going on here.

102
00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.900
Now!

103
00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.200
You and I have the same employer.

104
00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.400
We all work
for the Umbrella Corporation.

105
00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:57.700
The mansion above us
is an emergency entrance to the Hive.

106
00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:02.100
You are security operatives
placed there to protect that entrance.

107
00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.700
What about this?

108
00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.600
Your marriage is a fake.

109
00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:10.000
Just part of your cover
to protect the secrecy of the Hive.

110
00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:12.100
And what is the Hive?

111
00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.600
Show them.

112
00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:18.000
Accessing schematic of the Hive.

113
00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.600
Raccoon City. nearest urban center.

114
00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:22.600
The mansion where we found you...

115
00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:25.200
and through which we gained
access to the train...

116
00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:28.200
which. in turn.
brought us to the Hive.

117
00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:32.700
The Hive itself
is located underground...

118
00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.600
deep beneath the streets
of Raccoon City.

119
00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.300
A top-secret research facility...

120
00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.000
owned and operated
by the Umbrella Corporation...

121
00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:46.900
the Hive houses over 500 technicians.
scientists and support staff.

122
00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:50.000
They live and work underground.

123
00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.800
Their research
is of the highest importance.

124
00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:54.900
Its nature is classified.

125
00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:59.700
Our position on the map
is indicated by heat signature.

126
00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.200
Why can't I remember anything?

127
00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:18.200
The Hive has its own
defense mechanisms...

128
00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:20.000
all computer-controlled.

129
00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:23.700
A nerve gas was released
into the house.

130
00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.300
Primary effect of the gas--

131
00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:32.300
complete unconsciousness
lasting anything up to four hours.

132
00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:36.000
Secondary effects are varied.
but can include acute memory loss.

133
00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:38.000
- For how long?
- Subjective.

134
00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:40.000
An hour. day. week.

135
00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.400
So you're saying
this place was attacked?

136
00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.700
I'm afraid things are
a little more complicated than that.

137
00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.900
Sir! We've breached the Hive.

138
00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:01.600
J.D.

139
00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:30.200
Got it.

140
00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:44.900
Halon content has dissipated.

141
00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:07.800
Makes it easier to work underground.
thinking there's a view.

142
00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:31.400
Looks like we're taking the stairs.

143
00:23:41.800 --> 00:23:44.700
- Status.
- Red Queen is locked onto us.

144
00:23:44.700 --> 00:23:46.600
She knows that we're here.

145
00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:49.600
Who's the Red Queen?

146
00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:51.600
State-of-the-art
artificial intelligence.

147
00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:54.500
She is the computer
that controls the Hive.

148
00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:11.200
This is gonna slow us down.

149
00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:14.700
Our route to the Queen
takes us straight through these labs.

150
00:24:14.700 --> 00:24:18.000
Rain. J.D.. see how bad
the flooding is.

151
00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:20.400
Kaplan. find us
an alternate route.

152
00:24:23.700 --> 00:24:24.900
What happened here?

153
00:24:29.600 --> 00:24:32.100
Five hours ago.
Red Queen went homicidal.

154
00:24:32.100 --> 00:24:34.200
Sealed the Hive
and killed everyone down here.

155
00:24:34.200 --> 00:24:36.500
-Jesus.
- When we realized what was happening...

156
00:24:36.500 --> 00:24:38.800
my team was dispatched
to shut her down.

157
00:24:38.800 --> 00:24:40.200
Why did she do it?

158
00:24:40.200 --> 00:24:42.900
That we don't know.

159
00:24:42.900 --> 00:24:46.100
But outside interference
is a possibility.

160
00:24:46.100 --> 00:24:47.400
Jesus!

161
00:25:01.500 --> 00:25:04.200
Hey. You okay?

162
00:25:08.900 --> 00:25:10.400
- Here.
- No.

163
00:25:10.400 --> 00:25:11.900
- I'm fine.
- Please. come on.

164
00:25:11.900 --> 00:25:13.300
It's cold in here.

165
00:25:22.400 --> 00:25:23.700
Are you--

166
00:25:26.300 --> 00:25:31.700
Do you remember anything
from before this?

167
00:25:34.700 --> 00:25:37.900
No. Nothing before the train.

168
00:25:39.900 --> 00:25:41.600
And you?

169
00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:45.900
No. Nothing.

170
00:25:47.100 --> 00:25:50.000
I found an alternate route.
but it's gonna cost us time.

171
00:25:50.000 --> 00:25:53.700
We double back.
cut through Dining Hall B...

172
00:25:53.700 --> 00:25:55.500
then we're right on track.

173
00:26:10.500 --> 00:26:13.800
Sir. no go.
The whole level's flooded.

174
00:26:13.800 --> 00:26:16.500
All right.
we're behind schedule.

175
00:26:16.500 --> 00:26:18.600
So let's move it.

176
00:26:24.200 --> 00:26:25.600
Come on.

177
00:26:32.500 --> 00:26:34.500
Poor bastards.

178
00:27:21.800 --> 00:27:23.700
Dining Hall B.

179
00:27:23.700 --> 00:27:26.200
That's what it says on the map.

180
00:27:26.200 --> 00:27:28.500
Maybe you're reading it wrong.

181
00:27:28.500 --> 00:27:32.100
Maybe the corporation's
keeping a few secrets down here.

182
00:27:32.100 --> 00:27:33.700
Something you're
not supposed to see.

183
00:27:34.800 --> 00:27:38.200
J.D.. you and Rain keep the prisoner
here and secure the exit.

184
00:27:38.200 --> 00:27:41.200
Sir. halon levels
are nonexistent in this room.

185
00:27:41.200 --> 00:27:43.700
I think the system malfunctioned.

186
00:27:43.700 --> 00:27:46.200
All right.
There may be survivors.

187
00:27:46.200 --> 00:27:48.200
Give me a search line.
but keep it tight.

188
00:27:52.100 --> 00:27:53.500
Move it.

189
00:28:44.700 --> 00:28:48.200
- I said keep it tight.
- Sorry.

190
00:28:50.400 --> 00:28:53.700
I'm not sure I want to remember
what went on down here.

191
00:28:57.500 --> 00:28:59.500
I don't blame you.

192
00:28:59.500 --> 00:29:02.500
What do they keep in these things?

193
00:29:02.500 --> 00:29:04.800
How do I know?

194
00:29:29.600 --> 00:29:31.400
What's taking so long?

195
00:29:31.400 --> 00:29:35.800
Red Queen's defenses are in place.
She's making it difficult.

196
00:29:40.100 --> 00:29:41.400
Let's pack it up.

197
00:29:54.300 --> 00:29:56.100
You stay here.

198
00:30:29.400 --> 00:30:32.700
The lights are automated.
Nothing to worry about.

199
00:30:52.300 --> 00:30:54.500
- Transmitter in position.
- Roger.

200
00:30:54.500 --> 00:30:56.600
Running the bypass.

201
00:31:16.000 --> 00:31:17.900
Checkmate.

202
00:31:26.700 --> 00:31:27.900
Move up.

203
00:31:32.900 --> 00:31:36.900
- What is that?
- That's what will shut the Queen down.

204
00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:39.000
Delivers a massive
electrical charge.

205
00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:41.100
Scrambles the mainframe
and forces it to reboot.

206
00:31:50.900 --> 00:31:53.900
Some kind of dormant
defense mechanism.

207
00:31:53.900 --> 00:31:55.700
- Opening the door tripped it.
- Put it back to sleep.

208
00:31:55.700 --> 00:31:57.000
Working on it.

209
00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:03.200
- Would you open that door now. please?
- I'm trying.

210
00:32:03.200 --> 00:32:06.200
Hold your positions.
Everyone stay calm.

211
00:32:06.200 --> 00:32:07.700
What's that?

212
00:32:09.000 --> 00:32:11.100
- Kaplan. quick!
- We gotta get them out of there!

213
00:32:11.100 --> 00:32:13.500
- Kaplan. you've gotta hurry!
- Come on!

214
00:32:14.500 --> 00:32:16.000
Down! Get down!

215
00:32:17.500 --> 00:32:20.600
- Look out! Something's killing them!
-Jesus! Come on. man.

216
00:32:20.600 --> 00:32:22.000
Don't do this to me!

217
00:32:23.300 --> 00:32:25.200
Medic! Medic!

218
00:32:34.200 --> 00:32:36.000
- Open the door!
- Open this door!

219
00:32:36.000 --> 00:32:38.300
- I am trying.
- Stay conscious.

220
00:32:38.300 --> 00:32:40.300
You're going into shock.
Stay awake!

221
00:32:41.200 --> 00:32:44.400
- I am almost there.
- Sir! It's coming back!

222
00:32:44.400 --> 00:32:46.000
- Open the door!
- I'm trying!

223
00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:47.200
Well. try harder!

224
00:32:47.900 --> 00:32:49.200
It's coming back!

225
00:32:58.500 --> 00:33:00.400
Oh. God!

226
00:33:00.400 --> 00:33:03.000
-Just do it!
- I'm almost there.

227
00:33:03.000 --> 00:33:04.500
Come on!

228
00:33:06.900 --> 00:33:08.400
- Shit!
- Got it.

229
00:33:33.800 --> 00:33:35.700
All right.

230
00:33:35.700 --> 00:33:37.200
Let's do it.

231
00:33:38.700 --> 00:33:40.000
Do what?

232
00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:42.300
We have to complete the mission.

233
00:33:42.300 --> 00:33:44.300
There is no way
I'm going down there.

234
00:33:45.700 --> 00:33:47.800
Her defenses are down.

235
00:33:47.800 --> 00:33:49.800
D�j� vu. anyone?

236
00:34:52.000 --> 00:34:53.500
Keep going.

237
00:35:28.100 --> 00:35:29.700
Give me a hand.

238
00:35:44.500 --> 00:35:47.500
Get out! Get out!
You can't be in here.

239
00:35:47.500 --> 00:35:49.400
Don't listen
to anything she says.

240
00:35:49.400 --> 00:35:51.700
She's a holographic
representation of the Red Queen.

241
00:35:51.700 --> 00:35:53.300
You have to get out!

242
00:35:53.300 --> 00:35:55.600
Modeled after
the head programmer's daughter.

243
00:35:55.600 --> 00:35:57.800
She'll try to deceive us.
confuse us.

244
00:35:57.800 --> 00:36:02.400
I wouldn't advise this. Disabling me
will result in loss of primary power.

245
00:36:02.400 --> 00:36:05.700
She'll say anything to stop us
from shutting her down.

246
00:36:05.700 --> 00:36:08.100
I implore you.

247
00:36:08.100 --> 00:36:11.600
- Implore away.
- Please?

248
00:36:13.300 --> 00:36:14.800
Please?

249
00:36:15.900 --> 00:36:18.800
You're all going to die down here.

250
00:37:19.200 --> 00:37:23.000
That pulse forces the circuit breaker to
shut down her mainframe for 30 seconds.

251
00:37:23.800 --> 00:37:26.200
After that. if I don't have
her board. she can reboot.

252
00:37:36.200 --> 00:37:37.900
They're late.

253
00:37:46.700 --> 00:37:48.200
I'm on it.

254
00:38:35.900 --> 00:38:38.700
J.D.. we got a survivor!

255
00:38:38.700 --> 00:38:40.800
It's okay.
We're here to help.

256
00:38:42.900 --> 00:38:44.900
You seem to be in some serious--

257
00:38:48.600 --> 00:38:51.500
Get off of me!
Get off of me!

258
00:38:53.300 --> 00:38:55.600
J.D.. get her off of me
before I stab her ass!

259
00:38:59.300 --> 00:39:01.100
Are you okay?

260
00:39:01.100 --> 00:39:05.400
She bit me. man.
She took a chunk clean right out of me.

261
00:39:07.000 --> 00:39:08.500
Stay down.

262
00:39:09.500 --> 00:39:11.200
I'm warning you. stay down!

263
00:39:11.200 --> 00:39:12.300
She's crazy.

264
00:39:15.200 --> 00:39:16.800
Come any closer. and I'll fire.

265
00:39:18.700 --> 00:39:20.100
I mean it!

266
00:39:22.200 --> 00:39:23.400
Damn you.

267
00:39:43.200 --> 00:39:47.600
I shot her five times.
How was she still standing?

268
00:39:47.600 --> 00:39:49.600
Bitch isn't standing now.

269
00:39:54.300 --> 00:39:58.100
- What was all the shooting?
- We found a survivor.

270
00:39:58.100 --> 00:40:02.400
- And you shot him?
- She was crazed. She bit me.

271
00:40:03.800 --> 00:40:06.200
She's gone. She's gone!

272
00:40:07.700 --> 00:40:09.100
That's bullshit!

273
00:40:09.100 --> 00:40:11.800
She fell right here.
but she's gone!

274
00:40:13.700 --> 00:40:15.700
Look. look at this.

275
00:40:15.700 --> 00:40:18.200
There's blood.
but it's not much.

276
00:40:19.700 --> 00:40:21.900
Looks like it's coagulated.

277
00:40:23.300 --> 00:40:26.000
- Yeah.
- It's not possible.

278
00:40:26.000 --> 00:40:27.100
Why not?

279
00:40:28.900 --> 00:40:32.400
Because blood doesn't do that
till after you're dead.

280
00:40:32.400 --> 00:40:34.200
Can we go now?

281
00:40:34.200 --> 00:40:37.700
We're not going anywhere
till the rest of the team get here.

282
00:40:42.000 --> 00:40:46.600
- There's no one else coming.
- What the fuck are you talking about?

283
00:40:46.600 --> 00:40:48.000
Wait.

284
00:40:49.600 --> 00:40:51.000
Quiet.

285
00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:27.700
Fuck!

286
00:41:27.700 --> 00:41:30.400
Don't come any closer!
They're behind us.

287
00:41:30.400 --> 00:41:32.700
Jesus!

288
00:41:34.600 --> 00:41:35.800
They're everywhere.

289
00:41:36.500 --> 00:41:38.900
They're everywhere.
They're all around us.

290
00:42:02.000 --> 00:42:03.900
I said stay back!

291
00:42:12.900 --> 00:42:14.900
Why aren't they dying?

292
00:42:23.400 --> 00:42:26.500
Watch the tank! The tank!

293
00:42:34.000 --> 00:42:36.000
- Let's go!
- Hurry up!

294
00:42:36.000 --> 00:42:37.800
- Wait!
- Come on. let's go!

295
00:42:37.800 --> 00:42:39.600
- Move!
- Keep moving! Come on!

296
00:42:44.400 --> 00:42:45.700
Move!

297
00:42:58.200 --> 00:43:00.000
I can help you get the virus.

298
00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:04.000
I have access to security codes.
surveillance plans. the works.

299
00:43:22.000 --> 00:43:23.800
Shit!

300
00:43:30.600 --> 00:43:33.200
- We lost the others!
- Keep moving!

301
00:43:41.900 --> 00:43:44.300
- You waited?
- Didn't know the code.

302
00:43:44.300 --> 00:43:46.100
Come on. come on.

303
00:43:46.100 --> 00:43:47.800
- Shit!
- Come on.

304
00:44:02.100 --> 00:44:03.500
- Come on.
- Hurry up.

305
00:44:03.500 --> 00:44:05.300
- Come on. man.
- Shit!

306
00:44:06.800 --> 00:44:08.700
- What's taking so long?
- I'm trying!

307
00:44:26.400 --> 00:44:27.400
Come on.

308
00:44:30.400 --> 00:44:32.400
- Move! What's the code?
- Hurry up!

309
00:44:32.400 --> 00:44:34.100
I'm running out of ammo!

310
00:44:34.100 --> 00:44:36.900
Zero. four. three. two--
No. five!

311
00:44:36.900 --> 00:44:39.700
- What?
- Zero. four. three--

312
00:44:39.700 --> 00:44:41.900
- What is the code?
- Zero. four...

313
00:44:41.900 --> 00:44:44.600
zero. three. one...

314
00:44:44.600 --> 00:44:46.500
nine. six. five.

315
00:44:47.200 --> 00:44:50.300
- Got it?
- See how easy that was?

316
00:44:51.500 --> 00:44:53.000
- Shit!
-J.D.. no!

317
00:44:56.400 --> 00:44:58.600
Grab my hand. man!
Come on!

318
00:44:58.600 --> 00:45:00.800
Don't let go!

319
00:45:09.400 --> 00:45:12.100
-J.D.!
- Rain!

320
00:46:01.000 --> 00:46:04.100
Where are the bodies?
Where did they go?

321
00:46:04.100 --> 00:46:05.000
Fuck!

322
00:46:08.300 --> 00:46:10.900
Whatever they are.
there's too many of them out there.

323
00:46:10.900 --> 00:46:14.800
Whatever they are?
It's pretty obvious what they are.

324
00:46:14.800 --> 00:46:18.500
Lab coats. badges.
Those people used to work here!

325
00:46:18.500 --> 00:46:21.000
All the people working here
are dead.

326
00:46:21.000 --> 00:46:24.000
Well. that isn't stopping them
from walking around.

327
00:46:24.000 --> 00:46:27.700
Well. where did they come from?
Why didn't we see them on the way in?

328
00:46:27.700 --> 00:46:30.400
When you cut the power.
you unlocked the doors.

329
00:46:30.400 --> 00:46:31.800
You let them out.

330
00:46:42.100 --> 00:46:44.600
We're never gonna make it
to the surface.

331
00:48:45.800 --> 00:48:48.000
You are security operatives.

332
00:48:48.000 --> 00:48:50.900
Security operatives placed there
to protect that entrance.

333
00:51:46.700 --> 00:51:50.400
I've got one in the breech
and an extra mag.

334
00:52:16.900 --> 00:52:18.100
Lisa?

335
00:52:45.500 --> 00:52:47.700
I can help you get the virus.

336
00:52:47.700 --> 00:52:51.700
I have access to security codes.
surveillance plans. the works.

337
00:52:52.000 --> 00:52:53.800
But?

338
00:52:53.800 --> 00:52:55.800
- But there's gonna be a price.
- Name it.

339
00:53:03.600 --> 00:53:06.700
- Who was she?
- My sister.

340
00:53:14.700 --> 00:53:19.100
Corporations like Umbrella
think they're above the law.

341
00:53:20.700 --> 00:53:22.600
But they're not.

342
00:53:26.300 --> 00:53:29.600
There are hundreds of thousands
of us who think the same...

343
00:53:29.600 --> 00:53:31.500
all over the world.

344
00:53:34.500 --> 00:53:37.000
Some of us provide information...

345
00:53:37.900 --> 00:53:41.000
others give their support.

346
00:53:41.000 --> 00:53:44.400
Some take more direct action.

347
00:53:44.400 --> 00:53:46.100
Like you.

348
00:53:48.100 --> 00:53:50.200
If your friends had been
a little more thorough...

349
00:53:50.200 --> 00:53:52.800
they would've seen
right through my false ID.

350
00:53:55.300 --> 00:53:57.700
Then all the red flags
would've gone off--

351
00:53:57.700 --> 00:54:01.700
Quantico. NSA. ViCAP.
all the rest.

352
00:54:03.000 --> 00:54:06.100
There's no way
I could've infiltrated the Hive.

353
00:54:07.400 --> 00:54:09.400
So you sent your sister.

354
00:54:13.500 --> 00:54:15.800
We needed something concrete.

355
00:54:15.800 --> 00:54:18.800
Anything to expose Umbrella
to the press.

356
00:54:18.800 --> 00:54:21.700
Proof of the research
that was going on down here.

357
00:54:22.500 --> 00:54:24.500
What kind of research?

358
00:54:24.500 --> 00:54:26.400
The illegal kind.

359
00:54:28.000 --> 00:54:29.200
Genetic.

360
00:54:30.600 --> 00:54:32.100
Viral.

361
00:54:35.700 --> 00:54:37.500
My sister was going to smuggle out...

362
00:54:37.500 --> 00:54:40.300
a sample of the virus
they were developing.

363
00:54:43.500 --> 00:54:46.100
So how was she
going to make it out of here?

364
00:54:46.100 --> 00:54:51.000
She had a contact within the Hive.
someone I never met.

365
00:54:51.000 --> 00:54:56.000
They had access to security codes.
surveillance. everything she needed.

366
00:54:56.000 --> 00:54:58.300
So why didn't she make it?

367
00:55:00.300 --> 00:55:02.000
Maybe she trusted
the wrong person.

368
00:55:03.900 --> 00:55:06.200
Maybe they set her up.

369
00:55:06.200 --> 00:55:08.700
Kept the virus for themselves.

370
00:55:10.500 --> 00:55:14.000
Do you know how much the T-virus
would be worth on the open market?

371
00:55:15.600 --> 00:55:18.900
- What. worth all this?
- Yeah.

372
00:55:18.900 --> 00:55:21.100
To someone.

373
00:55:28.300 --> 00:55:29.900
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

374
00:55:29.900 --> 00:55:33.200
- Close that door!
- They're right behind us!

375
00:55:35.900 --> 00:55:37.600
Get off! Get off!

376
00:55:37.600 --> 00:55:38.900
Stop it!

377
00:55:41.000 --> 00:55:43.400
Son of a bitch!

378
00:55:43.400 --> 00:55:46.500
- You okay?
- Yeah.

379
00:55:46.500 --> 00:55:49.500
Right behind us.
What about this door?

380
00:55:49.500 --> 00:55:54.000
- They're waiting out there too.
- And that way?

381
00:55:54.000 --> 00:55:57.600
It's a dead end. There's no way
out of the Queen's chamber.

382
00:55:57.600 --> 00:55:58.900
So we wait.

383
00:55:58.900 --> 00:56:02.900
If someone doesn't hear from you.
they'll send backup or something.

384
00:56:02.900 --> 00:56:04.000
Right?

385
00:56:07.600 --> 00:56:09.500
What? What's wrong?

386
00:56:10.900 --> 00:56:13.100
We don't have much time.

387
00:56:13.100 --> 00:56:15.100
You know those blast doors
we passed...

388
00:56:15.100 --> 00:56:17.200
on the way in from the mansion?

389
00:56:17.200 --> 00:56:19.100
They seal shut
in just under an hour.

390
00:56:20.200 --> 00:56:23.400
If we're not out of here by then.
we're not getting out.

391
00:56:23.400 --> 00:56:26.700
What are you talking about?
They can't just bury us alive down here.

392
00:56:30.800 --> 00:56:34.700
Containing the incident
is the only fail-safe plan they had...

393
00:56:36.000 --> 00:56:38.000
against possible contamination.

394
00:56:40.600 --> 00:56:44.400
And you're only telling us this now.
when we're trapped...

395
00:56:44.400 --> 00:56:46.400
half a mile underground?

396
00:56:46.400 --> 00:56:49.100
We have to find a way
out of this room.

397
00:56:51.300 --> 00:56:52.400
What are you doing?

398
00:56:56.500 --> 00:56:59.500
- Where are you taking those?
- I'm turning her back on.

399
00:56:59.500 --> 00:57:02.400
- That is not a good idea.
- She'll know a way out of here.

400
00:57:08.000 --> 00:57:09.800
That homicidal bitch
killed my team.

401
00:57:09.800 --> 00:57:13.000
That homicidal bitch
may be our only way out of here.

402
00:57:13.000 --> 00:57:17.000
Considering the way she's being treated.
I'm sure she'll be happy to help us out.

403
00:57:17.200 --> 00:57:19.400
That circuit breaker
you were talking about.

404
00:57:19.400 --> 00:57:21.000
- Can you bypass it?
- Yeah.

405
00:57:21.000 --> 00:57:22.400
So do it.

406
00:57:29.100 --> 00:57:31.500
All right.
circuit breaker is disabled.

407
00:57:31.500 --> 00:57:35.100
This time if I hit the switch.
she won't be able to shut down.

408
00:57:35.100 --> 00:57:36.400
She's gonna fry.

409
00:57:40.100 --> 00:57:42.100
Kaplan?

410
00:57:42.100 --> 00:57:44.200
The initial charge
must have damaged her boards.

411
00:57:44.200 --> 00:57:45.700
Ah. there you are.

412
00:57:46.600 --> 00:57:49.900
Things. I gather.
have gone out of control.

413
00:57:49.900 --> 00:57:53.500
Give me that fucking switch right now.
I'm gonna fry your ass.

414
00:57:53.500 --> 00:57:55.700
I did warn you. didn't I?

415
00:57:55.700 --> 00:57:58.000
Tell us what's going on down here.

416
00:57:58.000 --> 00:58:00.100
Research and development.

417
00:58:00.100 --> 00:58:01.900
What about the T-virus?

418
00:58:01.900 --> 00:58:05.400
The T-virus was
a major medical breakthrough...

419
00:58:05.400 --> 00:58:11.000
although it clearly also possessed
highly profitable military applications.

420
00:58:11.000 --> 00:58:13.000
How does it explain
those things out there?

421
00:58:13.000 --> 00:58:16.200
Even in death. the human body
still remains active.

422
00:58:16.200 --> 00:58:18.200
Hair and fingernails
continue to grow.

423
00:58:18.900 --> 00:58:20.700
New cells are produced...

424
00:58:20.700 --> 00:58:23.900
and the brain itself
holds a small electrical charge...

425
00:58:23.900 --> 00:58:26.700
that takes months to dissipate.

426
00:58:26.700 --> 00:58:29.400
The T-virus
provides a massive jolt...

427
00:58:29.400 --> 00:58:31.400
both to cellular growth...

428
00:58:31.400 --> 00:58:34.400
and to those trace
electrical impulses.

429
00:58:34.400 --> 00:58:36.300
Put quite simply...

430
00:58:36.300 --> 00:58:38.900
it reanimates the body.

431
00:58:38.900 --> 00:58:41.200
It brings the dead back to life?

432
00:58:41.200 --> 00:58:42.900
Not fully.

433
00:58:42.900 --> 00:58:46.600
The subjects have
the simplest of motor functions.

434
00:58:46.600 --> 00:58:50.400
Perhaps a little memory.
Virtually no intelligence.

435
00:58:50.400 --> 00:58:53.100
They are driven by
the basest of impulses...

436
00:58:53.100 --> 00:58:55.500
the most basic of needs.

437
00:58:55.500 --> 00:58:56.700
Which is?

438
00:58:56.700 --> 00:58:58.400
The need to feed.

439
00:59:03.500 --> 00:59:05.100
How do you kill them?

440
00:59:05.100 --> 00:59:08.700
Severing the top of the spinal column
or massive trauma to the brain...

441
00:59:08.700 --> 00:59:11.700
are the most effective methods.

442
00:59:11.700 --> 00:59:14.500
You mean shoot them in the head.

443
00:59:14.500 --> 00:59:16.500
Why did you kill
everybody down here?

444
00:59:16.500 --> 00:59:20.300
The T-virus escaped
into the air conditioning system...

445
00:59:20.300 --> 00:59:23.900
and an uncontrolled
pattern of infection began.

446
00:59:23.900 --> 00:59:25.700
The virus is protean...

447
00:59:25.700 --> 00:59:29.400
changing from liquid to airborne
to blood transmission...

448
00:59:29.400 --> 00:59:31.800
depending on its environment.

449
00:59:31.800 --> 00:59:34.400
It's almost impossible to kill.

450
00:59:34.400 --> 00:59:37.500
I couldn't allow it
to escape from the Hive...

451
00:59:37.500 --> 00:59:40.400
so I took steps.

452
00:59:41.200 --> 00:59:43.800
- Steps.
- You must understand.

453
00:59:43.800 --> 00:59:47.300
Those who become infected.
I can't allow you to leave.

454
00:59:47.300 --> 00:59:49.400
Whoa. We're not infected.

455
00:59:49.400 --> 00:59:54.400
Just one bite. one scratch
from these creatures is sufficient...

456
00:59:54.400 --> 00:59:58.000
and then you become one of them.

457
00:59:59.000 --> 01:00:03.400
A check of my systems indicates
my main drive circuit breaker...

458
01:00:03.400 --> 01:00:05.600
has been disabled.

459
01:00:05.600 --> 01:00:07.600
May I ask why?

460
01:00:07.600 --> 01:00:10.200
Insurance.
We need a way out of here.

461
01:00:10.200 --> 01:00:13.200
If you refuse to help at any time.
we flip the switch.

462
01:00:13.200 --> 01:00:15.200
Understand?

463
01:00:25.700 --> 01:00:27.000
After you.

464
01:00:36.700 --> 01:00:38.800
What the hell is this place?

465
01:00:38.800 --> 01:00:40.100
The utility tunnels.

466
01:00:40.100 --> 01:00:43.500
They run underneath the Hive
for water. gas and power lines.

467
01:00:56.700 --> 01:00:59.000
- It's been in here before.
- Keep moving.

468
01:00:59.000 --> 01:01:01.900
-We're going around in circles.
-This is the route the computer gave us.

469
01:01:01.900 --> 01:01:04.500
- Why are you listening to her?
- Enough already!

470
01:01:04.500 --> 01:01:08.100
We have no choice but to keep moving
'cause those things are right behind us.

471
01:01:14.900 --> 01:01:16.800
That mesh isn't gonna hold.
Keep moving.

472
01:01:20.800 --> 01:01:23.700
Jesus Christ! Hold it!
There's too many of them!

473
01:01:26.700 --> 01:01:27.800
-Jesus!
- Fuck!

474
01:01:41.400 --> 01:01:43.900
Up on the pipes.
Up on the pipes!

475
01:01:45.100 --> 01:01:46.200
Quickly. everyone!

476
01:01:47.400 --> 01:01:49.400
- Let's go!
- Come on! There's a way up!

477
01:01:49.400 --> 01:01:51.100
Watch out! Keep 'em back!

478
01:01:52.900 --> 01:01:54.900
Go on up! Move it!

479
01:01:59.200 --> 01:02:00.600
Shit. Okay.

480
01:02:10.100 --> 01:02:14.800
Get over here! There's too many of them!
Come on! Go. go. go!

481
01:02:14.800 --> 01:02:16.000
Go on!

482
01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:19.100
Go! Go! I can manage!

483
01:02:23.200 --> 01:02:24.200
Gotcha!

484
01:03:02.100 --> 01:03:04.100
Rain?

485
01:03:04.100 --> 01:03:06.400
Rain.

486
01:03:06.400 --> 01:03:07.600
What?

487
01:03:07.600 --> 01:03:10.400
We have to do something
about your wounds.

488
01:03:11.400 --> 01:03:12.900
I'm fine.

489
01:03:14.600 --> 01:03:16.200
I said I'm fine.

490
01:03:23.400 --> 01:03:25.700
You like that. don't you?
Huh?

491
01:03:27.600 --> 01:03:30.000
You like the way it tastes.
don't you?

492
01:03:32.100 --> 01:03:34.200
Like the taste of that?

493
01:03:41.900 --> 01:03:43.300
She was right.

494
01:03:46.700 --> 01:03:48.700
We're all gonna die down here.

495
01:03:48.700 --> 01:03:51.500
No. We're getting out.

496
01:03:51.500 --> 01:03:53.000
All of us.

497
01:04:36.600 --> 01:04:39.200
Kaplan. are you okay?

498
01:04:55.300 --> 01:04:56.900
Oh. God!

499
01:05:06.900 --> 01:05:08.700
Hold on!

500
01:05:20.500 --> 01:05:23.200
- Help him.
- I can't.

501
01:05:24.200 --> 01:05:26.500
- What are you waiting for?
- I can't focus!

502
01:05:30.500 --> 01:05:31.600
I can't see!

503
01:05:37.500 --> 01:05:40.400
- Kaplan. go up!
- Get up there!

504
01:05:40.400 --> 01:05:42.800
You almost got it.
Keep going!

505
01:05:42.800 --> 01:05:45.500
- Come on! Come on!
- You can do it!

506
01:05:47.100 --> 01:05:48.600
You got it!

507
01:05:48.600 --> 01:05:51.300
- Okay. Kaplan.
-Just stay there!

508
01:05:51.300 --> 01:05:53.500
Hold on.
We're gonna come get you.

509
01:05:53.500 --> 01:05:57.400
Cut this wire and throw it to him.
Then we can go get him.

510
01:05:57.400 --> 01:05:58.800
Hold on!

511
01:06:04.700 --> 01:06:06.200
That's lucky.

512
01:06:09.300 --> 01:06:10.600
I want you to go.

513
01:06:16.200 --> 01:06:18.800
- We're not leaving you. Kaplan.
- Yes. you are.

514
01:06:20.300 --> 01:06:23.200
You can't kill all of them.

515
01:06:23.200 --> 01:06:26.000
And I'm not going anywhere.

516
01:06:26.000 --> 01:06:28.800
I want you to go. Now!

517
01:06:28.800 --> 01:06:30.000
Please.

518
01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:31.900
Just do it.

519
01:06:33.600 --> 01:06:35.900
Just do it now!

520
01:06:35.900 --> 01:06:37.200
Please.

521
01:06:38.500 --> 01:06:39.900
Go!

522
01:07:07.700 --> 01:07:10.600
You're gonna have to work
for your meal!

523
01:07:42.300 --> 01:07:43.600
Come on.

524
01:07:52.700 --> 01:07:56.000
Give me your arm.
Up over my shoulder.

525
01:07:56.000 --> 01:07:58.400
Ready? There we go.

526
01:08:39.700 --> 01:08:41.700
When I get out of here...

527
01:08:43.100 --> 01:08:45.200
I think I'm gonna get laid.

528
01:08:45.200 --> 01:08:48.700
Yeah. You might want to
clean up a little bit first.

529
01:08:57.400 --> 01:08:58.800
Hey. wait.

530
01:09:04.300 --> 01:09:05.700
Are you okay?

531
01:09:52.600 --> 01:09:55.500
Blue for the virus.
Green for the antivirus.

532
01:10:00.400 --> 01:10:03.000
- There's a cure.
- What are you talking about?

533
01:10:03.800 --> 01:10:05.400
There's a cure.

534
01:10:06.500 --> 01:10:08.900
The process can be reversed.

535
01:10:10.300 --> 01:10:11.800
There's a cure!

536
01:10:11.800 --> 01:10:13.800
You're gonna be okay!

537
01:10:14.700 --> 01:10:16.600
I was beginning to worry.

538
01:10:24.400 --> 01:10:26.800
This is where
they kept the T-virus.

539
01:10:28.600 --> 01:10:30.500
How do you know all this?

540
01:10:33.400 --> 01:10:35.300
Because I was gonna steal it.

541
01:10:38.500 --> 01:10:40.400
I was your sister's contact.

542
01:10:42.800 --> 01:10:45.000
- You betrayed her.
- I don't know.

543
01:10:45.000 --> 01:10:48.000
- You caused all of this.
- I can't remember.

544
01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:49.600
The truth.

545
01:10:49.600 --> 01:10:52.400
I don't remember the truth.

546
01:11:26.000 --> 01:11:27.400
I don't understand!

547
01:11:30.700 --> 01:11:31.800
It's gone.

548
01:11:32.900 --> 01:11:34.300
It's not there.

549
01:11:36.100 --> 01:11:37.600
I can't.

550
01:11:38.700 --> 01:11:40.100
I just can't.

551
01:11:40.100 --> 01:11:41.600
It's over.

552
01:11:50.200 --> 01:11:52.300
I can help you get the virus.

553
01:11:52.300 --> 01:11:55.900
I have access to security codes.
surveillance plans. the works.

554
01:11:57.300 --> 01:11:59.400
But there's gonna be a price.

555
01:11:59.400 --> 01:12:01.500
Name it.

556
01:12:01.500 --> 01:12:06.400
You have to guarantee me that
you will bring this corporation down.

557
01:12:24.300 --> 01:12:26.500
Spence?

558
01:12:45.200 --> 01:12:47.300
Thank you.

559
01:12:57.200 --> 01:12:58.200
Spence?

560
01:13:23.300 --> 01:13:27.100
We can still make it out of here.
Come with me.

561
01:13:29.700 --> 01:13:33.000
We can have everything
we've ever wanted.

562
01:13:33.000 --> 01:13:34.900
Money's out there waiting.

563
01:13:35.700 --> 01:13:38.800
You wouldn't believe how much.

564
01:13:38.800 --> 01:13:42.400
Is that how you thought
all my dreams were gonna come true?

565
01:13:43.400 --> 01:13:44.900
Please.

566
01:13:44.900 --> 01:13:47.900
I wouldn't want to shoot you.

567
01:13:47.900 --> 01:13:50.500
Might need the bullets.

568
01:13:51.900 --> 01:13:54.100
Back off.

569
01:13:58.300 --> 01:14:00.600
I won't take any part in this.

570
01:14:00.600 --> 01:14:02.700
Okay. but you can't just...

571
01:14:03.500 --> 01:14:05.600
wash your hands of this.

572
01:14:05.600 --> 01:14:08.600
We work for the same company.
You knew what they did.

573
01:14:08.600 --> 01:14:11.300
I was trying to stop them.

574
01:14:12.800 --> 01:14:14.200
You really believe that...

575
01:14:15.800 --> 01:14:17.300
people like him...

576
01:14:17.300 --> 01:14:19.700
will ever change anything?

577
01:14:22.100 --> 01:14:23.400
Nothing...

578
01:14:23.400 --> 01:14:26.200
ever changes.

579
01:14:28.100 --> 01:14:29.700
Where is...

580
01:14:30.900 --> 01:14:32.400
the antivirus?

581
01:14:33.100 --> 01:14:34.500
It's on the train...

582
01:14:36.400 --> 01:14:38.100
where you found me.

583
01:14:39.400 --> 01:14:42.400
Couldn't have been standing
more than three feet from it.

584
01:14:43.700 --> 01:14:46.200
I so nearly made it out.

585
01:14:48.200 --> 01:14:53.500
Didn't realize that bitch of a computer
had defense systems outside the Hive.

586
01:14:55.200 --> 01:14:57.900
In or out?

587
01:14:57.900 --> 01:14:59.700
In...

588
01:14:59.700 --> 01:15:01.300
or out?

589
01:15:01.300 --> 01:15:02.900
I don't know what we had...

590
01:15:04.200 --> 01:15:05.200
but it's over.

591
01:15:12.100 --> 01:15:13.300
Back...

592
01:15:16.000 --> 01:15:17.700
the fuck off.

593
01:15:29.000 --> 01:15:31.000
I'm missing you already.

594
01:15:40.500 --> 01:15:42.800
Your boyfriend's a real asshole.

595
01:15:42.800 --> 01:15:45.200
He shot the locking mechanism out.

596
01:15:46.300 --> 01:15:50.100
I can't believe that son of a bitch
is gonna get away with this.

597
01:15:50.100 --> 01:15:51.900
I don't think so.

598
01:15:54.600 --> 01:15:57.700
I've been a bad. bad girl.

599
01:16:57.600 --> 01:16:58.700
Oh. my God.

600
01:17:14.500 --> 01:17:17.000
What the fuck is that?

601
01:17:17.000 --> 01:17:19.800
One of the Hive's
early experiments...

602
01:17:19.800 --> 01:17:23.800
produced by injecting the T-virus
directly into living tissue.

603
01:17:23.900 --> 01:17:26.900
The results were unstable.

604
01:17:26.900 --> 01:17:30.900
Now that it has fed on fresh DNA.
it will mutate...

605
01:17:38.300 --> 01:17:41.000
becoming a stronger.
faster hunter.

606
01:17:42.000 --> 01:17:43.100
Great.

607
01:17:44.200 --> 01:17:47.300
If you knew it was loose.
why didn't you warn us?

608
01:17:48.300 --> 01:17:51.400
'Cause she was saving it for us.

609
01:17:52.500 --> 01:17:53.700
Isn't that right?

610
01:17:53.700 --> 01:17:57.200
I didn't think any of you
would make it this far.

611
01:17:57.200 --> 01:17:58.800
Not without infection.

612
01:17:58.800 --> 01:18:02.400
Why didn't you tell us
about the antivirus?

613
01:18:02.400 --> 01:18:04.500
This long after infection...

614
01:18:04.500 --> 01:18:06.800
there's no guarantee
it would work.

615
01:18:08.400 --> 01:18:12.200
But there's a chance. right?

616
01:18:12.200 --> 01:18:14.600
I don't deal in chance.

617
01:18:22.700 --> 01:18:24.000
Fuck it.

618
01:18:35.200 --> 01:18:36.800
No pressure. guys.

619
01:18:36.800 --> 01:18:40.100
You require
the four-digit access code.

620
01:18:40.100 --> 01:18:45.300
I can give you the code.
but first you must do something for me.

621
01:18:45.300 --> 01:18:48.300
- What do you want?
- One of your group is infected.

622
01:18:48.300 --> 01:18:51.300
I require her life
for the code.

623
01:18:51.300 --> 01:18:54.300
The antivirus
is right there on the platform.

624
01:18:54.300 --> 01:18:56.700
- It's right there!
- I'm sorry.

625
01:18:56.700 --> 01:18:59.300
It's a risk I cannot take.

626
01:19:02.500 --> 01:19:03.500
She's right.

627
01:19:04.300 --> 01:19:05.400
It's the only way.

628
01:19:05.400 --> 01:19:07.500
You're gonna have to kill me.

629
01:19:11.100 --> 01:19:13.700
Otherwise we all die down here.

630
01:19:20.800 --> 01:19:22.400
The glass is reinforced...

631
01:19:22.400 --> 01:19:24.600
but it won't hold forever.

632
01:19:28.900 --> 01:19:30.800
- Do it.
- No.

633
01:19:30.800 --> 01:19:32.400
- Get up.
-Just do it.

634
01:19:32.400 --> 01:19:34.500
- Rain. please get up.
- Do it!

635
01:19:34.500 --> 01:19:36.900
- You don't have long to decide.
- Get up. please.

636
01:19:36.900 --> 01:19:39.600
- You have no choice.
- Kill her.

637
01:19:39.600 --> 01:19:42.300
Kill her now.
You don't have any choice.

638
01:19:42.300 --> 01:19:45.200
-Just do it now!
- I can't!

639
01:19:45.200 --> 01:19:47.000
- Please.
- Do it.

640
01:19:47.000 --> 01:19:48.500
- Kill her.
-Just do it.

641
01:19:48.500 --> 01:19:50.100
Kill her now!

642
01:19:53.300 --> 01:19:54.200
Kill her!

643
01:20:24.300 --> 01:20:27.500
The bitch wouldn't open the door.
so I had to fry her.

644
01:20:29.900 --> 01:20:30.800
Move.

645
01:20:39.700 --> 01:20:41.800
What the fuck was that?

646
01:20:41.800 --> 01:20:43.700
It's a long story.

647
01:21:02.800 --> 01:21:04.300
Start it up.

648
01:21:05.300 --> 01:21:07.400
I'll get the virus.

649
01:21:42.900 --> 01:21:44.800
I'm missing you already.

650
01:21:50.500 --> 01:21:51.900
Okay. we're in business.

651
01:21:53.400 --> 01:21:54.500
Full power.

652
01:21:55.200 --> 01:21:56.700
We're leaving!

653
01:22:13.700 --> 01:22:16.600
I don't want to be
one of those things...

654
01:22:19.400 --> 01:22:22.200
walking around
without a soul.

655
01:22:24.000 --> 01:22:26.100
You won't.

656
01:22:26.100 --> 01:22:28.100
When the time comes...

657
01:22:29.500 --> 01:22:31.700
you'll take care of it.

658
01:22:33.600 --> 01:22:35.600
No one else is gonna die.

659
01:22:37.600 --> 01:22:38.900
Okay?

660
01:22:47.700 --> 01:22:49.200
Here.

661
01:23:52.700 --> 01:23:54.300
I'm not dead yet.

662
01:23:55.600 --> 01:23:58.000
I think I'll have that back.

663
01:24:01.500 --> 01:24:03.800
I could kiss you. you bitch.

664
01:24:08.100 --> 01:24:09.900
What's going on back there?

665
01:24:22.100 --> 01:24:26.100
- Get us the fuck out of here!
- Any faster. we'll come off the rails!

666
01:25:42.500 --> 01:25:44.500
Open the doors!

667
01:26:07.600 --> 01:26:09.400
Open the doors!

668
01:26:09.400 --> 01:26:10.800
Now!

669
01:27:55.600 --> 01:27:58.200
I failed all of them.

670
01:28:00.900 --> 01:28:02.300
I failed.

671
01:28:04.200 --> 01:28:05.700
Listen to me.

672
01:28:05.700 --> 01:28:08.400
There is nothing else
you could've done.

673
01:28:08.400 --> 01:28:10.900
The corporation's guilty here.
not you.

674
01:28:10.900 --> 01:28:13.500
And we finally have the proof.

675
01:28:13.500 --> 01:28:15.700
That way Umbrella can't get--

676
01:28:16.800 --> 01:28:18.200
get away with this.

677
01:28:22.000 --> 01:28:23.200
What is it?

678
01:28:26.000 --> 01:28:28.600
You're infected.
but you're gonna be okay.

679
01:28:28.600 --> 01:28:30.000
I'm not losing you.

680
01:28:38.400 --> 01:28:39.800
Help!

681
01:28:39.800 --> 01:28:41.900
Help him.
What are you doing?

682
01:28:53.600 --> 01:28:54.900
Matt!

683
01:28:55.700 --> 01:28:57.700
He's mutating.

684
01:28:59.500 --> 01:29:02.400
I want him in the Nemesis Program.

685
01:29:05.900 --> 01:29:07.300
Get off!

686
01:29:08.600 --> 01:29:09.800
What's happening?

687
01:29:15.500 --> 01:29:16.600
Matt!

688
01:29:35.300 --> 01:29:36.800
I want her quarantined.

689
01:29:36.800 --> 01:29:39.900
Close observation
and a full series of blood tests.

690
01:29:41.900 --> 01:29:44.500
Let's see if she's infected.

691
01:29:44.500 --> 01:29:46.900
Take her to
the Raccoon City facility.

692
01:29:48.000 --> 01:29:50.000
Then assemble the team.

693
01:29:50.000 --> 01:29:52.600
We're reopening the Hive.

694
01:29:52.600 --> 01:29:55.100
I want to know
what went on down there.

695
01:29:56.500 --> 01:29:58.500
Just do it.

696
01:31:09.900 --> 01:31:11.300
Who's in there?

697
01:31:14.200 --> 01:31:15.600
Let me out!

698
01:31:16.700 --> 01:31:18.100
Let me out!

699
01:31:19.400 --> 01:31:21.400
Who's in there?

700
01:31:22.305 --> 01:32:22.198
